      "message": "Hi\nI\u0027m adding ABI symbol list to support chip ST54H (STMicroelectronics )\nThe spi drvier of chip ST54H need call spi_set_cs_timing to set Ese-SPI CSN_CLK delay\n\nBelow is driver code:\n\nst54spi.c\n----------------\n1028 static int st54spi_probe(struct spi_device *spi)\n1029 {\n     ......\n1088 // this method exists since kernel 5.3\n1089 // it uses u8 parameter in kernel 5.4 (clk count) and spi_delay parameter in kernel 5.5 (clk_count fobidden)\n1090 // target 10us delay \u003d\u003d\u003e use CLK\u003d4MHz and value 31 (even if u8 data, some platforms limit to 0-31)\n1091 spi_set_cs_timing(spi, 31, 0, 0);\n     ......\n1132 }\n",
